# Clarion site key, in two halves.
#
# Both hold the SAME value. They are separate variables because they are
# exposed differently, and mixing them up is the whole point of the split:
#
#   CLARION_SITE_KEY              server-only. Read by app/api/verify-insurance
#                                 to deliver leads. Must NEVER gain a
#                                 NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix — that would ship the
#                                 lead-delivery key to every visitor.
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_CLARION_SITE_KEY  deliberately public. The Clarion chat widget
#                                 and the blog feed both run in the browser and
#                                 cannot work without it.
#
# Set both in Vercel for Production, Preview and Development.
CLARION_SITE_KEY=cpx_replace_me
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLARION_SITE_KEY=cpx_replace_me
